  "claim": "Revolution Studios produced The Benchwarmers, which starred Rob Schneider and Napoleon Dynamites lead actor, Jon Heder.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Jon Heder. Sentence: Jonathan Joseph \"Jon\" Heder ( ) (born October 26, 1977) is an American actor and producer.\nPage: Jon Heder. Sentence: His feature film debut came in 2004 as the title character of the comedy film \"Napoleon Dynamite\".\nPage: Jon Heder. Sentence: He has also acted in the films \"The Benchwarmers\", \"School for Scoundrels\", \"Blades of Glory\", \"Mama's Boy\", \"When in Rome\", and \"Walt Before Mickey\" as Roy Disney, and provided voice talents in the animated films \"Monster House\" and \"Surf's Up\", as well as the \"Napoleon Dynamite\" animated series.\nPage: The Benchwarmers. Sentence: It stars Rob Schneider, David Spade, and Jon Heder.\nPage: The Benchwarmers. Sentence: It is produced by Revolution Studios and Happy Madison Productions and is distributed by Columbia Pictures.",
