        "original_id": "c0da55b6-975d-5c47-9155-02a91a1226e3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jon Heder, Rob Schneider, David Spade, Roy Disney\n- Products: Napoleon Dynamite, The Benchwarmers, School for Scoundrels, Blades of Glory, Mama's Boy, When in Rome, Walt Before Mickey, Monster House, Surf's Up, Napoleon Dynamite animated series\n- Companies: Revolution Studios, Happy Madison Productions, Columbia Pictures\n- Roles: actor, producer, voice actor\n\nFacts:\n- Jon Heder was born on October 26, 1977, and he is an American actor and producer.\n- Jon Heder made his feature film debut in 2004 as the title character of the comedy film Napoleon Dynamite.\n- Jon Heder acted in the films The Benchwarmers, School for Scoundrels, Blades of Glory, Mama's Boy, When in Rome, and Walt Before Mickey.\n- Jon Heder portrayed Roy Disney in Walt Before Mickey.\n- Jon Heder provided voice talent in the animated films Monster House and Surf's Up and in the Napoleon Dynamite animated series.\n- The Benchwarmers stars Rob Schneider, David Spade, and Jon Heder.\n- The Benchwarmers was produced by Revolution Studios and Happy Madison Productions and was distributed by Columbia Pictures.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
